<info type="Plot Summary">When Haruhiro came to, he was in the darkness. Not knowing why was he here, or where &quot;here&quot; even was. With him were others who also remembered little more than their own names. What they found when they came out of the underground was a world that was &quot;just like a game.&quot; In order to survive, Haruhiro forms a party with others in the same situation as him, learns Skills, and takes his first steps forward into the world of Grimgar as a Trainee Volunteer Soldier. &lt;em class=de-emphasized&gt;(from manga)&lt;/em&gt;</info>
